{%- if request.locale.iso_code == 'en' -%}
<section class="wp-block-group alignfull hero has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained mg-cs-1240" style="min-height:72vh;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60)">

<div class="blob blob--rose" style="width:min(34vw,360px);aspect-ratio:1;top:6%;left:-7%;"></div>
<div class="blob blob--sage" style="width:min(26vw,290px);aspect-ratio:1;bottom:8%;right:-5%;"></div>

<div class="wp-block-group hero-split is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow">

<div class="hero__media"><img src="{{ 'art-21.webp' | asset_url }}" width="1200" height="1600" alt="Mural: a child in a yellow raincoat unearthing a glowing seed" decoding="async" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high"></div>

<div class="wp-block-group hero-split__text is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow">

<p class="hero__eyebrow">On walls</p>

<h1 class="wp-block-heading">Murals</h1>

<p class="hero__lede has-large-font-size">I love creating murals that transform a space by bringing in atmosphere, presence, and a sense of story. I’m especially drawn to projects that leave room for imagination, poetry, and a certain visual softness.</p>

<div class="wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-button"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="#formulaire">Tell me about your idea!</a></div>
<div class="wp-block-button is-style-outline"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="{{ r }}pages/portfolio-murales">See the murals</a></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>


<div class="wp-block-group alignwide is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow" style="padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)">

<p class="pull-quote">“I enjoy composing images that respond to a place while bringing in a touch of dream and magic.”</p>
</div>


<section class="wp-block-group alignfull atelier has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained mg-cs-720" style="padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60)">

<div class="blob blob--lilac" style="width:min(28vw,300px);aspect-ratio:1;top:10%;right:-6%;"></div>
<div class="blob blob--sage" style="width:min(24vw,260px);aspect-ratio:1;bottom:12%;left:-5%;"></div>
<figure class="art-float art-float--left" data-reveal><img src="{{ 'art-20.webp' | asset_url }}" width="1200" height="1600" alt="Mural: a child in a blue raincoat smelling a flower from which letters escape" decoding="async" loading="lazy"></figure>
<figure class="art-float art-float--right" data-reveal><img src="{{ 'art-22.webp' | asset_url }}" width="1200" height="1600" alt="Mural “The tree of knowledge”: a flowering tree whose branches carry letters" decoding="async" loading="lazy"></figure>
<p class="has-text-align-center eyebrow">Your wall</p>
<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center">A mural project?</h2>

<p class="has-text-align-center has-large-font-size" style="margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)">Do you have a mural project in mind? I love imagining murals that transform a space and give it a unique atmosphere. Whether it’s for a private home, a business, a cultural space, or a more personal project, we always begin with a conversation to define the mood, subject, dimensions, timeline, and budget together.</p>
</section>


<div class="wp-block-group alignwide band is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow">

<div class="wp-block-group band__head is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow">

<h2 class="wp-block-heading">How it works</h2>
</div>

<div class="wp-block-group band__body is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow">

<ol class="wp-block-list steps"><li>You get in touch with your mural idea.</li><li>We discuss the location, dimensions, subject, desired mood, timeline, and budget.</li><li>A commission agreement is confirmed, and a 50% deposit is requested to reserve the project and begin the preparation phase.</li><li>I begin the research and sketching process.</li><li>I send you sketches for approval. Up to three rounds of revisions are included at this stage.</li><li>Once the final sketch is approved, I begin the mural.</li><li>When the project is complete, minor adjustments can be made if needed.</li><li>The final invoice is paid before or at the end of the project, according to the agreed terms.</li></ol>
</div>
</div>


<div class="wp-block-group alignwide band is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow">

<div class="wp-block-group band__head is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow">

<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Pricing and timelines</h2>
</div>

<div class="wp-block-group band__body is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow">

<div class="wp-block-group note has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained">

<p>My pricing is based on several factors: the size of the surface to be painted, the complexity of the project, the level of detail, the materials required, the preparation time, and the time needed to complete the mural on site. Since each mural is unique, timelines also vary depending on the scope of the project and my availability at the time of the request.</p>


<p>To prepare an accurate and tailored proposal, I ask for a few essential details at the first contact stage: the approximate dimensions of the surface, the location, the intended dates for the mural, and an idea of the theme or atmosphere you have in mind.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>


<div class="wp-block-group alignwide band is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow">

<div class="wp-block-group band__head is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow">

<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Project agreement</h2>
</div>

<div class="wp-block-group band__body is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow">

<div class="wp-block-group note has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained">

<p>To ensure a clear and reassuring process, each mural is covered by a written agreement outlining the project subject, price, deposit, timeline, included revisions, and production terms. This helps establish the project from the start and allows it to unfold smoothly through to completion.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>


<div class="wp-block-group alignwide form-band is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow" id="formulaire">
{% render 'request-form', type: 'mural' %}
</div>
